---
layout: base.njk
workspace: true
scripts: ["/js/tool-ui.js", "/js/convert.js"]
---
{# convert.njk — Layout for pages with the MP4 converter. Pages supply their words in the front matter.
  Facts and questions shared by every convert page live here and in src/_data/convertFaq.json. #}
<h1>{{ h1 }}</h1>
<p class="s">{{ intro | safe }}</p>
{% include "partials/converttool.njk" %}
<details class="supporting"><summary>Help, size guides and questions</summary>
<div class="supporting-content">
<p class="also">Need to make a video smaller instead? <a href="/">Compress a video&nbsp;→</a></p>
{%- set sizes = convertLinks %}
{%- set sizesHeading = "Other formats" %}
{% include "partials/sizelinks.njk" %}
{{ content | safe }}
<h2>What to know</h2>
<ul>
  {%- for f in facts %}
  <li>{{ f | safe }}</li>
  {%- endfor %}
  <li>If the video is already H.264 with AAC sound, it is copied into an MP4 without re-encoding: quick, and no quality is lost.</li>
  <li>Anything else is converted to H.264 video and AAC sound, which play almost everywhere. That takes longer.</li>
  <li>The picture size and frame rate stay the same.</li>
  <li>It reads MOV, MKV, WebM, MP4 and MPEG-TS files. AVI and WMV are not supported.</li>
  <li>Converting can make the file bigger. To make it smaller, use the <a href="/">compressor</a> afterwards.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Questions</h2>
<div class="faq-list">
  {%- for item in convertFaq %}
  <details><summary>{{ item.q }}</summary><p>{{ item.a }}</p></details>
  {%- endfor %}
</div>
</div></details>
<script type="application/ld+json">{{ { page: page, site: site, h1: h1, description: description, faq: convertFaq } | toolSchema | safe }}</script>
